stem information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21025.15011) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 15.90 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nApparently RenderingServer mesh_get_surface doesn't return valid lods data.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/rendering_server.cpp#L2031\n\nThanks to blackshift for finding this out. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Import 3D model with LOD enabled\n- In script try to access lods data using RS.mesh_get_surface\n- Returns lods as array of arrays, not array of Dictionary with distance+index_data props\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[renderingserver_mesh_get_surface_2025-10-17_00-13-38.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22960124/renderingserver_mesh_get_surface_2025-10-17_00-13-38.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"l